msgstr "So installierst du sie"

#: plinius-boot:8811
msgid ""
"The Flatpak brings these programs along, so it seems to be damaged. Please "
"install it again."
msgstr ""
"Das Flatpak bringt diese Programme mit, es scheint also beschädigt zu sein. "
"Bitte installiere es erneut."

#: plinius-boot:8814
msgid "Run this in a terminal:"
msgstr "Führe das in einem Terminal aus:"

#: plinius-boot:8815
msgid "Command"
msgstr "Befehl"

